(7680852, 1256627, 86447, '<td valign="top">You are hilarious, Larry.<br/> <br/>Truly.<br/> <br/>I love it.</td>', 'You are hilarious, Larry. Truly. I love it.', '2020-12-04 00:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680854, 1256925, 96751, '<td valign="top">The lighting, the tones, the textures are splendid. But I find the expression a bit vacuous.</td>', 'The lighting, the tones, the textures are splendid. But I find the expression a bit vacuous.', '2020-12-04 00:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680855, 1256929, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great shot, Tib!</td>', 'Great shot, Tib!', '2020-12-04 00:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680857, 1256627, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL! I see your humor is intact!  Would love a bit of color correction on this.</td>', 'LOL! I see your humor is intact!  Would love a bit of color correction on this.', '2020-12-04 00:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680864, 1256727, 193969, '<td valign="top">Fantastic</td>', 'Fantastic', '2020-12-04 01:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680866, 1256925, 114285, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, looks like Wendys husband. Loving the high contrast look.</td>', 'Great portrait, looks like Wendys husband. Loving the high contrast look.', '2020-12-04 02:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680872, 1256906, 114285, '<td valign="top">I love caps more men should wear them. This is a very honest portrait Henk, well done.</td>', 'I love caps more men should wear them. This is a very honest portrait Henk, well done.', '2020-12-04 03:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680903, 1256928, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great pose, colors, and expression. Fantastic detail. To me, the part of the face closest to the camera seems a bit hot.</td>', 'Great pose, colors, and expression. Fantastic detail. To me, the part of the face closest to the camera seems a bit hot.', '2020-12-04 11:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680905, 1256808, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the moment. The brightest light washes out the hands, and draws attention to itself, and away from your main subject.</td>', 'Great capture of the moment. The brightest light washes out the hands, and draws attention to itself, and away from your main subject.', '2020-12-04 11:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680906, 1256627, 77196, '<td valign="top">And a clever mask makes the difference...</td>', 'And a clever mask makes the difference...', '2020-12-04 11:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680907, 1256685, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Amount of light on different parts of the face are just right - highlighting the expression, but almost hiding the ears. About the only thing distracting is the hoodie fold along the model-right neck, and that is minor (I think it is the light blue color.) Great detail.</td>', 'Nicely done. Amount of light on different parts of the face are just right - highlighting the expression, but almost hiding the ears. About the only thing distracting is the hoodie fold along the model-right neck, and that is minor (I think it is the light blue color.) Great detail.', '2020-12-04 11:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680908, 1256704, 77196, '<td valign="top">Emily is beautiful! The lighting and detail are great. I''m not sure if I like the image being off-center (or maybe it is the "almost touching" on the one side). My biggest "nit" is that you''ve introduced a shape that isn''t congruent with the rest of the image in the form a a triangle in the bottom right.</td>', 'Emily is beautiful! The lighting and detail are great. I''m not sure if I like the image being off-center (or maybe it is the "almost touching" on the one side). My biggest "nit" is that you''ve introduced a shape that isn''t congruent with the rest of the image in the form a a triangle in the bottom right.', '2020-12-04 12:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680909, 1256919, 77196, '<td valign="top">This made me smile. Lighting is great - the chin is almost over-bright, but the hair color balances it out.</td>', 'This made me smile. Lighting is great - the chin is almost over-bright, but the hair color balances it out.', '2020-12-04 12:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680910, 1256613, 77196, '<td valign="top">Ah - those eyes! They grab your attention immediately. Love how the face seems to float mid-pane. On the nit-picky side - what is that big white object in the left pane? But you have the right edge lined up with the eyes, so maybe it is part of the magic...</td>', 'Ah - those eyes! They grab your attention immediately. Love how the face seems to float mid-pane. On the nit-picky side - what is that big white object in the left pane? But you have the right edge lined up with the eyes, so maybe it is part of the magic...', '2020-12-04 12:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680911, 1256929, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love the face and the expression around the eyes. Fits B&amp;W great. I find the light areas in the lower part of the photo almost compete with the face for your attention.</td>', 'Love the face and the expression around the eyes. Fits B&W great. I find the light areas in the lower part of the photo almost compete with the face for your attention.', '2020-12-04 12:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680912, 1256904, 77196, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject and very, very nice lighting. I find her expression VERY neutral.</td>', 'Beautiful subject and very, very nice lighting. I find her expression VERY neutral.', '2020-12-04 12:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680915, 1256912, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and creative posing - with both subjects in profile. Focus is spot-on. For me, the background - though oof - detracts from the image through creating an artificial space for the main subject(s) to fit into (which they don''t quite - lamp intersects woman''s head, dog''s head is backed in its entirety by the wall), with the container of stuff above her knee, and the rectangle centered in the artificial space mentioned above.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and creative posing - with both subjects in profile. Focus is spot-on. For me, the background - though oof - detracts from the image through creating an artificial space for the main subject(s) to fit into (which they don''t quite - lamp intersects woman''s head, dog''s head is backed in its entirety by the wall), with the container of stuff above her knee, and the rectangle centered in the artificial space mentioned above.', '2020-12-04 12:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680917, 1256727, 77196, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Love the detail / focus on her face. Interesting use of dof.</td>', 'Beautiful image. Love the detail / focus on her face. Interesting use of dof.', '2020-12-04 12:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680918, 1256906, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Great lighting. Interesting expression (even though he looks less-than-impressed with you). And glasses with no reflections or hot spots.</td>', 'Nicely done. Great lighting. Interesting expression (even though he looks less-than-impressed with you). And glasses with no reflections or hot spots.', '2020-12-04 12:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680919, 1256890, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, and great eyes!</td>', 'Great lighting, and great eyes!', '2020-12-04 12:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680920, 1256914, 77196, '<td valign="top">Adorable. Excellent lighting.</td>', 'Adorable. Excellent lighting.', '2020-12-04 12:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680921, 1256827, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Slightly oof everywhere gives a bit misty feel to the shot. Danger of shooting for a lower perspective indoors is the ceiling/wall line impacting his neck.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Slightly oof everywhere gives a bit misty feel to the shot. Danger of shooting for a lower perspective indoors is the ceiling/wall line impacting his neck.', '2020-12-04 12:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
